    "voicelines": [
        {
            "type": "card_get",
            "text": "I'll keep chasing my dreams, \nand you'll keep being the wind beneath my wings!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_live_dial_card_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_myself.acb/vo_live_dial_card_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_myself.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "situation",
            "text": "Phew! Finally finished up all the paperwork~\nI wasn't actually expecting you to help out.\nI wasn't sure I'd get it done alone, so thanks for offering to help.\nWell, that's everything! How about we grab a bite to eat. My treat!\nWait a second, okay? I'm just gonna get ready.\nMy bag... ah, there it is! Thanks for wa—Ahh! Ahh!! The pile of papers!\nOh no... I'm sorry. Mind helping me clean this up?",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_situation.acb/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_situation.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "skill",
            "text": "Lemme show you what your XO is capable of!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_live_cmn_card_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_skill-card.acb/vo_live_cmn_card_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_skill-card.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_1",
            "text": "There's actually a hawk design on the lining. Pretty cool, right?",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-001.acb/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-001.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_2",
            "text": "I've gotta make my cape flutter if I wanna pull of the executive vibe, right? I'm just joking~",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-002.acb/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-002.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_3",
            "text": "Don't push yourself too hard! Taking breaks is important too!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-003.acb/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-003.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_4",
            "text": "Have you been keeping your room clean? I might stop by for a surprise inspection~",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-004.acb/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-004.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_5",
            "text": "If you have some time after work, let's chat for a while!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-005.acb/vo_card_cmn_00036_00036-5-uniq-0029-00_potential-005.mp3"
        }
    ],
